  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MoonThemedGame.Scavenger.SalvageSpawnLayout
  balanceNotes: '48 fixed part spawns in 12 four-part routes, reaching the southern
    basin and eastern perimeter. Default battery: 100 CRG, drain 1/s, cargo 4. Conservative
    route speed 4.55 m/s. First 12 parts cover the first three repair orders, without
    any gate or bridge. Outer routes use capacity/efficiency upgrades and the second
    charger. Gates and bridge unlock the outpost and later caches. Edit child positions
    and Part fields in this prefab or its scene instance.'
